# Keep local secrets and machine state out of every image build context (PLAT-4 review; the images
# themselves arrive with PLAT-3). `.env*` covers `.env`, `.env.local` and `.env.example`.
.env*
**/.env*
.local/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.git/

# Build output and caches: the images build from source (PLAT-3 decision 2.8).
**/.turbo/
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/.expo/
**/coverage/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
*.log
# Agent and editor state, and documents no image needs.
.claude/
.serena/
docs/
# Except the API contracts: packages/contracts generates the web app's clients from them (PLAT-15).
!docs/contracts/
adr/
